-link active\" id=\"__BVID__17___BV_tab_button__\" aria-controls=\"__BVID__17\">Overview</a></li><li role=\"presentation\" class=\"nav-item\"><a id=\"specsTab___BV_tab_button__\" role=\"tab\" tabindex=\"-1\" aria-selected=\"false\" aria-setsize=\"4\" aria-posinset=\"2\" aria-controls=\"specsTab\" href=\"#\" target=\"_self\" class=\"nav-link\">Specs</a></li><li role=\"presentation\" class=\"nav-item\"><a role=\"tab\" tabindex=\"-1\" aria-selected=\"false\" aria-setsize=\"4\" aria-posinset=\"3\" href=\"#\" target=\"_self\" class=\"nav-link\" id=\"__BVID__34___BV_tab_button__\" aria-controls=\"__BVID__34\">Packaging</a></li><li role=\"presentation\" class=\"nav-item\"><a role=\"tab\" tabindex=\"-1\" aria-selected=\"false\" aria-setsize=\"4\" aria-posinset=\"4\" href=\"#\" target=\"_self\" class=\"nav-link\" id=\"__BVID__39___BV_tab_button__\" aria-controls=\"__BVID__39\">Downloads / Documents</a></li><!----></ul></div><div id=\"tablistcontainer__BV_tab_container_\" class=\"tab-content mt-3 tabs-container\"><div role=\"tabpanel\" aria-hidden=\"false\" class=\"tab-pane col-12 col-xl-10 m-auto overview active\" id=\"__BVID__17\" aria-labelledby=\"__BVID__17___BV_tab_button__\"><div class=\"overview-description\"><div>\n<h2>Great for busy professionals, both protects and organizes</h2>\n</div>\n\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">Keep your treasured laptop and accessories safe and protected in the KNC-025 sleek portable laptop case. This polyester case is designed for on the go professionals with a padded compartment that securely fits up to 15.6in laptops. Keep your most essential accessories easily accessible and organized in the small zippered compartments located on its front side. This lightweight case is comfortably carried either by hand using the top handles or over your shoulder using the removable shoulder strap.</p>\n\n<ul>\n\t<li>Protection: Fully lined and padded main compartment featuring a padded divider with a securing strap for laptops of up to 15.6 inches.</li>\n\t<li>Organization: Separate and organize your essential accessories in the front zippered compartment with space for business cards, daily stationary, cell phones, and more.</li>\n\t<li>Convenience: Easily slip your laptop and files into the main compartment while your handheld essentials stay organized up front.</li>\n\t<li>Comfort: Includes a detachable and adjustable shoulder strap, handle straps and a trolley strap for added portability.</li>\n\t<li>Material: Made of durable polyester.</li>\n</ul></div></div> <div role=\"tabpanel\" id=\"specsTab\" aria-hidden=\"true\" aria-labelledby=\"specsTab___BV_tab_button__\" class=\"tab-pane col-12 m-auto specs\" style=\"display: none;\"><div id=\"specsContainer\" class=\"d-flex flex-wrap col-12 p-0\"><div class=\"col-12 col-sm-6 pb-2 mb-2\"><img src=\"https://klip-xtreme-frontend.s3.amazonaws.com/media/img/Icon-Specifications-grupo.png\" alt=\"Specifications\" height=\"25px\"> <h6 class=\"font-weight-bolder d-inline-block pl-2\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tSpecifications\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</h6> <hr> <div><div>\n<ul>\n\t<li>Compartments: Two zippered compartments</li>\n\t<li>Laptop compartment: 15x10x1in</li>\n\t<li>Materials: 840D polyester/210D polyester</li>\n\t<li>Exterior dimensions: 16.5x16x3in</li>\n\t<li>Weight: 1.3lb</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div></div></div></div> <div role=\"tabpanel\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"tab-pane col-12 col-xl-12 m-auto\" style=\"display: none;\" id=\"__BVID__34\" aria-labelledby=\"__BVID__34___BV_tab_button__\"><div class=\"col-12 col-lg-8 m-auto\"><div role=\"region\" id=\"carousel-fade\" aria-busy=\"false\" class=\"carousel slide\"><div id=\"carousel-fade___BV_inner_\" role=\"list\" class=\"carousel-inner\"><div role=\"listitem\" class=\"carousel-item active\" aria-current=\"true\" aria-posinset=\"1\" aria-setsize=\"2\" id=\"__BVID__37\"><img src=\"https://klip-xtreme-frontend.s3.amazonaws.com/media/img/KNC-025-box-01.jpg\" class=\"img-fluid w-100 d-block\"><!----></div><div role=\